%N A393787 Number of free tetrablocks that contain n regular tetrahedra.
%C A393787 Equivalence classes of bodies defined by n connected, regular, same-size, non-overlapping tetrahedra. Connected tetrahedra share an equilateral triangular face. Non-equivalent clusters cannot be made the same by rotations, translations or reflections.
%H A393787 David Ellsworth, Code Golf Stack Exchange, <a href="https://codegolf.stackexchange.com/a/283991/53884">Gluing tetrahedra together</a>
